{{Quote|This is a genuine architect droid head. A Mark IV. I haven't seen one for decades.|[[Rask Odai]]|<ref name="Steal" />}}
The '''Mark IV architect droid''' was an ancient model of [[architect droid]] which was over 25,000 standard years old predating the [[Galactic Republic]] itself, it was considered an antique by the [[Imperial Era]].<ref name="Steal" />

